  "prefLabel": "Puc 203.20 Transcripts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 203.20 Transcripts.\n\n(a) When the commission or any party desires a transcript of any proceeding, the commission shall order a transcript.\n\n(b) The charge for production of the transcription shall be paid by the utilities participating in the proceeding, or as otherwise directed, pursuant to RSA 365:37 and RSA 365:38.\n\n(c) Hearing transcripts shall be posted to the commission website.\n\n(d) The official transcript of the proceedings shall be the transcript obtained by the commission pursuant to Puc 203.20(a).\n\nSource. #8657-A, eff 6-10-06\n\nNew. #14184, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 203.31)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
